# ============================================================
#  Named conditions (docs/grimoire-script.md §9): call them in any expression, e.g. courting(lyra).
# ============================================================

@cond courting
desc: Not together and not exes: a romance with them is still open.
params: who
is: bond(who) != "partner" and bond(who) != "ex"

@cond partner_here
desc: Your partner, and around to be met in person now.
params: who
is: bond(who) == "partner" and around(who)

@cond spell_known
desc: You have learnt this spell (any level).
params: s
is: spell_level(s) >= 1

# Renown's tiers (design §8.2; the numbers match `tiers:` on @resource renown): the spotlight cards read these.
@cond renown_known
desc: The academy knows your face: renown 30 or more.
is: renown >= 30

@cond renown_famous
desc: The academy watches you: renown 60 or more.
is: renown >= 60

@cond renown_legend
desc: You are the academy's own story: renown 85 or more.
is: renown >= 85

@cond fallen_star
desc: Yesterday's news: you were Famous once (the flag is set on crossing into it) and are back under 30.
is: flag(was_famous) and renown < 30

# Between people (phase 4, content/events/between.grim): two characters, as each other's friend or foe.
@cond at_odds
desc: These two can't stand each other.
params: a b
is: npc_rel(a, b) <= -5

@cond get_along
desc: These two get on.
params: a b
is: npc_rel(a, b) >= 5

@cond classmate_here
desc: A fellow student you've met, around to be met in person now (not an outsider).
params: x
is: tagged(x, peer) and not tagged(x, outsider) and met(x) and around(x)

@cond fancy_free
desc: Free to fall for someone else: not your partner or your ex, and not sweet on you.
params: x
is: bond(x) != "partner" and bond(x) != "ex" and spark(x) < 30

@cond before_finals
desc: The two term months that lead up to each term's finals (3–4, 9–10), when exam help sells.
is: term and (month == 3 or month == 4 or month == 9 or month == 10)
